          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babemeelesi be banamae bipupu chielefu ne chimia bacha khu Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baboolela Musa bali, “Khwabalile banamae bali asi we bunyali bwefwe. Ne mbao akhaba mulala otibile tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khwareerire siianwa sia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, nisio buli mundu anyoolile: bibiindu bie esahabu, chipangili, chinaalo, chimbete, bipalakasa bie mu maru, ne bibiuma. Khubiaana khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nga kumuruungo kwe bubwoni bwefwe, ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ne omusaayi Eliesa babukula esahabu ne bibiindu bibiindi bioosi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne esahabu eye siianwa yoosi niyo baana khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khukhwama khu banamae babemeelesi be bipupu chielefu ne chimia chaba chishekeli chielefu ekhumi ne sita ne chimia saba ne kamakhumi karaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli omunamae ebukulila kimiaandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ne omusaayi Eliesa babukula esahabu khukhwama khu banamae babemeelesi be bipupu chielefu ne chimia mala bakirera mwieema lie kumuse. Bakirera nga likhebusia khulwe Baisiraeli ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
